    "%@ REC %@" : {
      "comment" : "Recording indicator beside the notch: a blinking dot, REC and the time. Keep it short. Recording indicator next to the camera notch: first %@ is a blinking dot ●/○, second is the time 0:42. Very short. Most languages keep “REC”.",
