    "Appear while playing. Arrow keys work too." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: the tortoise/hare speed buttons appear while scrolling; the up/down arrow keys also change speed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vises under afspilning. Piletasterne virker også."
          }
