    "about %@ to read" : {
      "comment" : "Below the script editor; the time is formatted by the system, e.g. “1 min, 20 sec” Below the editor, after the word count; %@ is a duration formatted by the system (e.g. “1 min, 20 sec”). Means: it takes about that long to read aloud.",
